  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-19T09:33:42.393Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be handy (for avatar creation) for PC users to see what a Quest user would see with an avatar. It's one thing to do this within Unity, but if uploading an avatar for both versions under the same blueprint ID, we should be able to view the avatar as a Quest user would.\nThis would also be useful in troubleshooting avatar issues. I've had a Quest user mention to me something was off with an avatar, and I wasn't able to see what they were talking about. I ended up going into Unity and uploading the avatar with a whole different Blueprint ID just to see it on PC.",
